WEBVTT

01:38.600 --> 01:41.880
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:45.280 --> 01:47.000
Out of fear that the truth would come out,

01:47.080 --> 01:48.400
Liu Yan ordered soldiers to attack us.

01:48.840 --> 01:50.280
We couldn't hold them off.

01:51.120 --> 01:53.280
General Wei Liang fought to
get me out of there,

01:53.920 --> 01:54.920
but he…

01:55.880 --> 01:56.800
He…

01:58.320 --> 01:59.400
It should've been me.

02:00.200 --> 02:02.520
Qiao Ci, look at me.

02:02.960 --> 02:04.680
Wei Liang went to fetch you, right?

02:05.480 --> 02:06.480
Where is he now?

02:07.280 --> 02:08.759
Look at me. Where is Wei Liang?

02:09.520 --> 02:11.280
He went to Yujun,
so tell me, where is he now?

02:12.200 --> 02:13.680
Look at me. Where is Wei Liang?

02:14.280 --> 02:15.720
Where is Wei Liang?

02:15.800 --> 02:16.600
Where is he?

02:16.680 --> 02:17.640
It should've been you.

02:17.720 --> 02:20.280
Why did it have to be him?
Why not a Qiao?

02:20.360 --> 02:21.200
Wei Xiao!

02:21.280 --> 02:22.280
My lord!

02:25.280 --> 02:26.040
Reporting!

02:26.880 --> 02:28.600
Liu Yan has taken Panyi with his troops.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.080
Pass down my orders.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.400
All troops, stay on alert.

02:40.120 --> 02:41.280
Tomorrow,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.160
we march on Panyi!

02:43.680 --> 02:44.520
Yes.

02:44.840 --> 02:45.680
My lord.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.400
My lord. My lord.

02:47.680 --> 02:49.360
Let me lead a team to bring him back.

02:49.440 --> 02:51.040
I asked Wei Liang to go. He'll be fine.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.400
- He just didn't see him.
- Wei Qu.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.000
- I'll get him back.
- Wei Qu, calm down!

02:54.080 --> 02:57.160
- Wei Qu!
- Let me bring him back!

03:11.400 --> 03:12.240
Get up.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.480
Get up.

03:14.400 --> 03:16.200
My lord, let me bring him back.

03:16.280 --> 03:17.080
Get up.

03:17.440 --> 03:18.600
Wei Liang will be okay.

03:18.680 --> 03:20.080
I'll go now. I'll bring him back!

03:20.160 --> 03:21.160
Wei Qu, hear my command.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.680
Tomorrow, take a cavalry unit

03:25.680 --> 03:26.520
to Kangjun.

03:27.800 --> 03:28.640
Find Qiao Ping.

03:30.920 --> 03:31.880
Bring…

03:33.800 --> 03:34.760
Wei Liang back.

03:36.800 --> 03:37.840
I will bring him back.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.400
Yes, my lord.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.480
- My lady.
- Manman. Manman.

03:52.560 --> 03:54.400
- My lady.
- Manman.

03:54.480 --> 03:55.960
- Manman.
- My lady.

04:07.840 --> 04:08.840
Lie down.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.160
My lord.

04:31.400 --> 04:32.600
Don't blame yourself.

04:37.240 --> 04:38.680
I just hate…

04:41.760 --> 04:44.520
that I can't take this pain for you.

04:46.840 --> 04:49.360
You grew up with Wei Liang.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.840
You weren't real brothers,

04:55.200 --> 04:56.800
but he was like a real brother to you.

04:58.840 --> 05:01.360
Now, he was killed because of my family.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.360
Even if we paid with our lives,

05:06.400 --> 05:08.800
it wouldn't ease your pain.

05:15.240 --> 05:19.040
I once promised you
that I'd give you more kids

05:20.560 --> 05:21.920
and restore the past glory.

05:24.360 --> 05:26.920
But now I've made you lose Wei Liang.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.240
And Xiaotao…

05:40.240 --> 05:42.080
She's still…

05:42.160 --> 05:44.600
She's still waiting for Wei Liang.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.400
This isn't your fault.

06:00.960 --> 06:03.320
You've tried to balance both clans.

06:03.400 --> 06:04.320
It's been exhausting.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.760
Besides,

06:08.760 --> 06:11.240
Qiao Yue and Liu Yan did this.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.920
You had nothing to do with it.

06:20.040 --> 06:21.480
I will never blame you

06:22.160 --> 06:23.120
for this.

06:27.800 --> 06:28.680
But from now on,

06:30.040 --> 06:31.040
I may…

06:31.120 --> 06:32.000
I understand.

06:34.280 --> 06:36.720
Whether it's to avenge Wei Liang,

06:38.040 --> 06:40.400
take back Panyi for the people,

06:42.720 --> 06:45.360
seek justice for General Wei Liang,

06:48.360 --> 06:50.720
or punish my uncle's betrayal,

06:52.160 --> 06:54.000
you must go to war at once.

07:06.040 --> 07:07.120
Don't worry.

07:09.520 --> 07:10.600
I don't blame you.

07:19.360 --> 07:20.400
Thank you, Manman.

07:24.320 --> 07:25.480
You've never failed me,

07:26.480 --> 07:27.520
and I will never fail you.

07:30.080 --> 07:31.080
I promise

07:32.360 --> 07:33.360
this matter

07:34.040 --> 07:35.400
will not implicate others.

07:36.400 --> 07:37.520
I give you my word.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.160
After I leave,

07:46.000 --> 07:47.280
take care of this family for me.

07:47.840 --> 07:48.920
Take care of yourself…

07:56.040 --> 07:57.560
and Feifei.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.440
I may not be back

08:06.360 --> 08:08.160
in time for Feifei's birth.

08:14.640 --> 08:15.920
That's okay.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.240
This time,

08:24.240 --> 08:26.360
I won't see you off.

08:28.120 --> 08:30.440
Be careful on your journey.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.120
Don't worry.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.559
YUJUN

08:41.520 --> 08:42.360
My lord, don't worry.

08:42.440 --> 08:44.440
Wei Xiao and I will protect Yujun.

08:44.520 --> 08:46.680
We'll patrol day and night.
Nothing will happen.

08:47.520 --> 08:49.400
Lady Xu and Lady Zhu
will take care of Her Ladyship.

08:49.480 --> 08:51.160
You have nothing to worry about.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.160
Good.

08:57.720 --> 08:59.160
- Depart!
- Yes!

09:35.120 --> 09:36.760
My lady, take care of yourself.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.640
Don't strain yourself or harm the baby.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.320
How's Xiaotao?

09:43.720 --> 09:45.000
Xiaotao…

09:59.320 --> 10:01.120
You're really going to Yanzhou?

10:01.480 --> 10:04.320
I'll go and pick a real Yanzhou orchid

10:04.400 --> 10:05.480
to propose to you with.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.680
Are you asking me to serve you?

10:13.760 --> 10:14.600
No need for that.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.120
Just marry me.

10:16.560 --> 10:17.800
Once I've saved up enough,

10:17.880 --> 10:19.960
I'll have His Lordship ask
for your mother's approval on my behalf.

10:20.440 --> 10:21.800
He values you.

10:22.240 --> 10:24.400
He's afraid he's not worthy of you,

10:24.480 --> 10:26.920
so he wants to do more.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.480
Only then will he feel at ease.

10:37.000 --> 10:37.760
You…

10:37.840 --> 10:38.800
Come back safe, okay?

10:38.880 --> 10:40.400
I've got your safety charm.

10:40.480 --> 10:43.240
Even if I get injured, I'll come back
and ask for your mother's approval.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.360
Pah, pah, pah.

10:44.440 --> 10:45.840
You won't get injured.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.800
Mine is a small gold dart.

10:56.360 --> 10:57.720
Every time we go to battle,

10:58.600 --> 11:00.200
we leave them at home.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.120
I want you to have this.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.320
Seeing it

11:03.760 --> 11:05.320
will be like seeing me.

11:44.840 --> 11:46.040
Before General Wei Liang died,

11:46.840 --> 11:48.400
he asked me

11:49.520 --> 11:51.000
to bring this orchid to you.

11:51.880 --> 11:53.960
He must not have wanted you
to grieve like this.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.200
He said…

12:00.440 --> 12:04.000
he'd bring the orchid and propose to me.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.640
Tell Xiaotao not to wait for me!

12:17.840 --> 12:19.480
This is from him.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.720
My mother said

12:23.640 --> 12:25.600
he was afraid I'd suffer

12:26.960 --> 12:29.080
and I'd look down on him one day,

12:29.840 --> 12:32.520
that's why he made
the betrothal gifts so complex.

12:33.760 --> 12:35.440
She asked me to let him.

12:37.200 --> 12:38.640
She said it would be more festive.

13:02.600 --> 13:05.200
PANYI CITY, YANZHOU

13:22.000 --> 13:22.840
Lord Yang.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.360
What's the situation in the city?

13:25.760 --> 13:26.920
The defenses are weak.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.040
We can't hold against Liangya.

13:28.120 --> 13:30.440
Panyi has completely fallen
into Liu Yan's hands.

13:33.520 --> 13:36.360
Lord Yang, we once helped Lord Qiao
knock at the gate.

13:37.160 --> 13:37.920
So now…

13:38.000 --> 13:40.480
Should we have to turn to Liangya now?

13:45.640 --> 13:46.720
Listen.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.080
ZHONGZHOU HAS DEFECTED

13:49.160 --> 13:53.520
Lady Yulou has swayed Zhongzhou,
dealing a major blow to Wei.

13:56.520 --> 13:59.000
Now, Wei Shao's allies are turning to me.

13:59.720 --> 14:01.920
I wonder how he can defy me now.

14:02.480 --> 14:05.560
But the Wei cavalry is still strong.

14:06.200 --> 14:08.240
Even without allies,
they're hard to defeat.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.400
Last time at Panyi,

14:11.480 --> 14:15.040
Liangya lost to them.

14:17.560 --> 14:18.720
Things are different now.

14:20.280 --> 14:22.720
Wei Shao must pass this way to reach us.

14:22.800 --> 14:23.560
YONGNING CITY

14:27.360 --> 14:28.320
Yongning City?

14:28.680 --> 14:32.120
He once built a dam here to divert floods.

14:32.200 --> 14:34.160
If the upper course breaks
and the lower course is blocked,

14:34.240 --> 14:37.240
what do you think will happen
when he passes through?

14:37.600 --> 14:38.720
Brilliant.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.760
If it works,

14:41.840 --> 14:44.920
this place will become Wei Shao's grave.

14:47.000 --> 14:48.000
That day,

14:48.840 --> 14:51.360
Lady Qiao scared off my reinforcements.

14:52.240 --> 14:54.640
Today, I shall return that disgrace

14:54.720 --> 14:56.000
in full.

15:03.360 --> 15:04.200
Who's there?

15:04.840 --> 15:05.840
Come in.

15:09.360 --> 15:11.240
I'm here to deliver a report.

15:19.360 --> 15:21.160
The Wei army is on the move.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.080
My lords, what shall we do?

15:23.160 --> 15:23.840
ZHONGZHOU HAS DEFECTED

15:25.320 --> 15:26.320
Just as expected.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.800
Lord Yang, guard the Panyi dam.

15:28.880 --> 15:29.960
Be ready to release the water.

15:30.040 --> 15:33.000
Yes. I'll prepare to open the gate.

15:33.080 --> 15:34.200
Not to open it.

15:35.000 --> 15:35.960
To destroy it.

15:39.800 --> 15:41.000
Destroy the dam?

15:41.720 --> 15:42.720
That can't be.

15:42.800 --> 15:44.360
I've observed the clouds.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.840
Heavy rains are coming.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.560
If we break the dam now,

15:48.640 --> 15:50.520
the flood downstream will be catastrophic.

15:51.000 --> 15:53.240
If the rain intensifies,

15:53.320 --> 15:55.280
the people will be doomed.

15:55.360 --> 15:56.640
The Lord of Wei…

15:56.720 --> 16:00.120
Wei Shao deserves it,
but the people along the way

16:00.200 --> 16:01.480
are innocent.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.800
To achieve greatness,
one can't fuss over trifles.

16:08.880 --> 16:10.360
Lord Yang, my late father trusted you.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.560
Surely you understand that.

16:11.640 --> 16:12.840
You call this a trifle?

16:28.360 --> 16:29.200
Fine.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.040
I understand.

16:32.520 --> 16:34.040
Governor, my lord,

16:34.120 --> 16:36.040
I'll do as you command.

16:37.120 --> 16:40.120
But the dam of the Yongning Canal

16:40.200 --> 16:41.400
is made of giant stones.

16:41.480 --> 16:42.480
It's hard to destroy.

16:42.840 --> 16:45.200
If we use sulfur as an explosive,

16:45.280 --> 16:48.120
it must be placed beneath
the load-bearing wooden beams.

16:50.200 --> 16:52.680
Without the right method, it won't work.

17:03.600 --> 17:04.400
My lord,

17:05.160 --> 17:07.359
he has a point.

17:17.720 --> 17:20.800
Then please wait here.

17:20.880 --> 17:23.400
I'll fetch the engineering diagram.

17:23.480 --> 17:26.560
With that, it'll be more effective.

17:26.640 --> 17:27.520
Very well.

17:27.599 --> 17:28.680
Be quick.

17:29.080 --> 17:29.920
Yes.

17:42.880 --> 17:45.640
The Yongning Canal project
is very complex,

17:45.720 --> 17:48.720
especially the section
from Panyi to Xindu.

17:48.800 --> 17:50.760
It took years to build.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.000
Now,

17:52.080 --> 17:53.720
it links two major rivers.

17:53.800 --> 17:58.080
I can't even tell if we're standing
above the Yang River

17:58.160 --> 17:59.280
or the Pei River.

17:59.360 --> 18:01.960
Lord Yang,
you took Wei's salary for years.

18:02.040 --> 18:05.360
Do you see yourself
as from Yanzhou or Wei?

18:07.400 --> 18:10.080
Does it matter?

18:11.240 --> 18:14.440
Lord Qiao devoted years to this dam

18:14.520 --> 18:16.640
to unify the land.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.320
He hoped for good traffic and trade

18:19.400 --> 18:22.080
so the people would no longer need
to travel long distances

18:22.160 --> 18:24.240
for water, food, and minerals.

18:25.640 --> 18:29.800
I've seen that same ambition

18:30.480 --> 18:32.960
not only in Lord Qiao
but in the Lord of Wei too.

18:36.040 --> 18:38.440
They say you built canals in Panyi

18:39.040 --> 18:40.480
and even in Rongjun.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.960
Panyi wasn't always

18:46.040 --> 18:47.800
a water town.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.400
It used to be a flood zone.

18:50.000 --> 18:53.240
Thanks to Lord Qiao's water management,
it became what it is today.

18:54.200 --> 18:58.480
I just followed him around,
digging trenches.

18:59.720 --> 19:01.720
That's how I gained a little experience

19:01.800 --> 19:03.880
in fighting back against
the floods of the Young River.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.920
That must've been hard.

19:06.000 --> 19:08.240
When this is over, you'll be rewarded.

19:09.680 --> 19:13.720
I'm just following orders.

19:13.800 --> 19:15.240
There's no hardship in that.

19:16.520 --> 19:18.000
But today,

19:21.160 --> 19:23.680
I'll have to fail Lord Qiao.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.640
Father built the canal for Yanzhou.

19:32.040 --> 19:33.720
Destroying it now

19:33.800 --> 19:37.200
is to eliminate a threat to Yanzhou.

19:37.280 --> 19:39.480
You won't fail him.

19:39.920 --> 19:41.360
Hurry and unroll the diagram.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.480
Let's get started.

19:44.240 --> 19:45.080
Sure.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.480
An assassin!

20:20.560 --> 20:21.560
Someone help!

20:22.280 --> 20:23.160
Don't move!

20:23.240 --> 20:24.480
What are you doing?

20:24.560 --> 20:26.800
I couldn't kill Liu Yan,

20:26.880 --> 20:28.480
but I can kill you!

20:28.560 --> 20:29.480
However,

20:29.560 --> 20:31.680
I'll have to fail Lord Qiao.

20:32.000 --> 20:33.640
Yang Feng, are you insane?

20:33.720 --> 20:35.560
How can you live after killing me?

20:36.440 --> 20:38.920
Without the dam and Panyi,

20:39.560 --> 20:42.160
what's the point of surviving alone?

20:43.000 --> 20:44.080
Let him go.

20:44.560 --> 20:45.680
I'll spare your life.

20:45.760 --> 20:47.680
If Zhen Zhi could die for the cause,

20:47.760 --> 20:49.280
so can I.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.640
My lord,

20:51.720 --> 20:53.000
don't push him.

20:53.600 --> 20:54.600
Fine.

20:55.560 --> 20:56.760
I'm sorry, Lord Qiao.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.440
HYDRAULIC ENGINEERING DIAGRAM

21:04.760 --> 21:05.720
You…

21:12.240 --> 21:13.040
My lord…

21:27.040 --> 21:29.320
Even a minor mayor dared defy me?

21:35.200 --> 21:36.240
Wei Shao,

21:37.000 --> 21:38.480
I'll kill you myself.

21:39.640 --> 21:42.440
HYDRAULIC ENGINEERING DIAGRAM

21:42.520 --> 21:44.160
Don't worry too much

21:44.240 --> 21:45.920
about Qiao and Liu.

21:46.800 --> 21:49.920
It had nothing to do with you or Ci.

21:50.720 --> 21:52.640
Zhonglin will handle it.

21:54.640 --> 21:57.000
Has your appetite become better?

21:57.520 --> 21:58.720
Yes.

21:58.800 --> 21:59.800
My lady.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.240
My lady.

22:01.880 --> 22:02.720
My lady.

22:03.200 --> 22:04.800
General Wei Xiao requests an audience.

22:05.200 --> 22:06.600
- Let him in.
- Yes.

22:07.920 --> 22:10.000
My ladies, news from the border.

22:10.080 --> 22:12.840
Su Ehuang and Xue Tai are leading
the Zhongzhou army to attack Yujun.

22:14.240 --> 22:15.880
Zhongzhou has defected too?

22:16.960 --> 22:19.120
How many troops are in Yujun now?

22:19.200 --> 22:22.120
My lady, our troops are fewer than 60,000.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.520
Besides the border garrisons,

22:24.600 --> 22:27.000
His Lordship also left 5,000 each
in Yunzhong and Rongjun.

22:28.160 --> 22:28.840
Grandmother,

22:29.760 --> 22:33.520
I believe we should dispatch couriers
to warn His Lordship

22:33.600 --> 22:35.120
so he'll be more careful.

22:35.880 --> 22:38.160
They can also alert the border generals

22:38.240 --> 22:40.080
to support one another

22:40.160 --> 22:41.440
in case they're attacked.

22:41.520 --> 22:42.480
Approved.

22:42.560 --> 22:43.560
Let's do as you suggest.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.880
Though the enemy is strong,

22:45.960 --> 22:48.680
the men of the Wei clan are battle-tested.

22:48.760 --> 22:50.280
Heaven favors Wei.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.600
We will overcome this.

22:52.680 --> 22:53.640
- Yes.
- Yes.

22:53.720 --> 22:54.560
General, please wait.

22:57.000 --> 22:57.800
Grandmother,

22:58.440 --> 23:00.360
Yujun is in grave danger.

23:00.440 --> 23:02.640
We should post a notice
to call on the people

23:02.720 --> 23:04.200
to defend Yujun with us.

23:04.960 --> 23:06.760
Anyone who volunteers

23:06.840 --> 23:09.480
can get armor and weapons in the office.

23:10.440 --> 23:13.120
Also, we should open the gates
for two days

23:13.520 --> 23:15.760
to let those who wish to go

23:15.840 --> 23:17.280
leave Yujun.

23:17.360 --> 23:20.160
When peace returns, they can come back.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.320
The Wei clan

23:21.400 --> 23:22.880
always puts the people first.

23:23.280 --> 23:24.160
Do as you say.

23:24.800 --> 23:26.200
- General Wei Xiao.
- Yes.

23:26.280 --> 23:29.920
Escort Lady Zhu and the Lady of Wei
out of the city.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.200
- Be quick.
- Yes.

23:31.280 --> 23:33.680
Grandmother, I can't leave.

23:34.240 --> 23:36.000
I must stay in Yujun.

23:36.080 --> 23:37.400
Before His Lordship left,

23:37.480 --> 23:39.800
I promised him that…

23:40.920 --> 23:42.680
- Lady Qiao.
- She's about to give birth.

23:42.760 --> 23:44.720
- Summon the physician!
- Hurry!

23:45.760 --> 23:47.240
Breathe. Breathe.

23:56.120 --> 23:57.120
Hurry!

24:00.680 --> 24:01.760
My lady, please wait outside.

24:06.120 --> 24:06.920
My lady.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.240
My lady, push!

24:08.720 --> 24:10.480
Come on, wipe her sweat.

24:10.560 --> 24:11.640
Don't panic, my lady.

24:11.720 --> 24:12.680
Just relax.

24:12.760 --> 24:13.520
Inhale. Push.

24:17.640 --> 24:19.520
My lady.

24:19.600 --> 24:20.680
Don't panic. Hurry.

24:20.760 --> 24:21.720
Relax.

24:35.600 --> 24:36.280
Watch out!

24:45.080 --> 24:45.800
Watch out!

24:47.800 --> 24:48.720
- Inhale.
- Inhale.

24:50.000 --> 24:50.840
Exhale.

24:53.720 --> 24:54.560
Not yet.

24:55.400 --> 24:56.480
Push again.

24:58.480 --> 24:59.320
Exhale.

25:00.000 --> 25:02.480
- Push!
- Push!

25:03.240 --> 25:04.080
Push!

25:05.080 --> 25:06.200
Push, my lady!

25:06.280 --> 25:07.240
Push!

25:13.160 --> 25:14.080
Bear with it.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.920
Come on, one, two.

25:24.240 --> 25:25.160
Push!

25:36.760 --> 25:37.560
Hurry!

25:37.640 --> 25:38.800
Lift!

25:43.800 --> 25:44.640
We can see the head.

25:44.720 --> 25:45.640
We can see the head!

25:45.720 --> 25:46.720
Push!

25:58.400 --> 25:59.320
The baby is here!

25:59.400 --> 26:00.400
The baby is here!

26:00.480 --> 26:01.240
The baby is here!

26:01.320 --> 26:03.160
- The baby is here.
- It's born.

26:06.720 --> 26:08.240
All right.

26:09.200 --> 26:11.200
Congratulations, my lady.
You have a child now.

26:36.920 --> 26:37.920
My lady,

26:38.000 --> 26:39.000
look.

26:39.520 --> 26:40.760
It's a little girl.

26:56.360 --> 26:57.640
Feifei.

27:00.920 --> 27:02.200
This is wonderful.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.240
Wonderful.

27:03.320 --> 27:04.440
Both of you are safe.

27:04.520 --> 27:05.680
Mother.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.240
Thank you.

27:09.640 --> 27:10.520
She looks adorable.

27:10.600 --> 27:12.640
How are you?
It must've been hard.

27:13.000 --> 27:13.920
Not at all.

27:14.000 --> 27:15.880
You're soaked in sweat.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.000
Report!

27:17.720 --> 27:19.400
Yunzhong, Rongjun,
and Hanjun have fallen.

27:19.480 --> 27:21.320
A force of 100,000 is marching on Yujun.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.680
What do we do?

27:24.760 --> 27:25.440
My lady!

27:25.520 --> 27:26.480
- What to do?
- Pack now.

27:26.560 --> 27:27.920
Let's bring Her Ladyship back to Yanzhou.

27:28.000 --> 27:29.440
- What should we do?
- What to do?

27:29.520 --> 27:30.280
Where do we go?

27:30.360 --> 27:31.680
- What should we do?
- What to do?

27:31.760 --> 27:32.560
Where can we go?

27:32.640 --> 27:33.520
Stop panicking.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.640
Grandmother,

27:36.720 --> 27:38.680
His Lordship left 60,000 men here.

27:39.520 --> 27:41.320
How many troops does he have?

27:45.680 --> 27:46.920
Building the Yongning Canal

27:47.000 --> 27:49.240
cost Wei dearly.

27:49.640 --> 27:51.680
We don't have many left.

27:51.760 --> 27:54.400
How is he supposed to fight?

27:56.480 --> 27:57.640
What to do?

28:00.320 --> 28:01.040
Good child.

28:01.520 --> 28:03.240
Since Zhonglin has arranged it,

28:03.720 --> 28:05.600
he must have a plan to win.

28:06.520 --> 28:07.560
Get some rest.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.360
I'll arrange for guards

28:09.440 --> 28:11.400
to escort you and Lady Zhu out.

28:14.000 --> 28:15.000
I can't leave.

28:16.080 --> 28:17.320
Grandmother.

28:18.480 --> 28:20.160
Before His Lordship left,

28:20.240 --> 28:21.960
I promised him

28:22.640 --> 28:24.360
to take care of everything at home

28:24.440 --> 28:26.560
with no mistakes.

28:30.200 --> 28:31.880
Grandmother, you are my family.

28:32.440 --> 28:34.360
Yujun is my home.

28:34.440 --> 28:36.160
I am the Lady of Wei.

28:36.800 --> 28:39.480
I will stand with the people of Yujun.

28:46.520 --> 28:47.680
I won't leave either.

28:48.680 --> 28:50.120
Stop making more trouble.

28:51.000 --> 28:52.080
My whole life,

28:52.920 --> 28:55.000
I've only ever wanted to make you happy,

28:56.440 --> 28:59.200
but I'm foolish and often fail.

29:00.880 --> 29:02.400
If you can see me differently

29:03.000 --> 29:04.720
when I choose to stay,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.400
then I won't leave.

29:08.600 --> 29:09.560
Yes.

29:10.000 --> 29:12.720
Though I'm afraid of death,

29:14.000 --> 29:15.280
my sons

29:16.680 --> 29:18.000
and my husband

29:18.760 --> 29:20.400
would never be deserters.

29:23.800 --> 29:26.160
I will never have them shamed

29:26.240 --> 29:27.920
because of me.

29:28.000 --> 29:28.840
Mother,

29:30.080 --> 29:31.560
please let me stay.

29:38.040 --> 29:39.160
I beg you.

29:44.320 --> 29:45.120
Look.

29:45.720 --> 29:46.880
These are

29:46.960 --> 29:48.680
the Ladies of Wei.

29:59.040 --> 30:00.400
She's smiling.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.080
My lord,

30:07.160 --> 30:10.800
just as expected, Liu Yan took Panyi
and destroyed the dam.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.720
The Yang River broke free,
flooding everything.

30:12.800 --> 30:15.800
He wants to trap us here
so we miss our chance.

30:17.640 --> 30:18.920
Anything else?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.560
The couriers report

30:21.920 --> 30:23.640
that Lord Zhen and Lord Yang
died for the cause.

30:25.720 --> 30:26.960
Qiao Yue is dead.

30:40.280 --> 30:41.560
How many of our men are left?

30:41.640 --> 30:42.760
Fewer than 70%.

30:46.480 --> 30:47.680
YUJUN

30:47.760 --> 30:49.000
PANYI

30:49.080 --> 30:50.680
We can't delay anymore.

30:51.240 --> 30:53.760
We must hurry to Panyi
and retake the Yongning Canal.

30:55.480 --> 30:56.320
Report!

30:57.880 --> 31:00.280
My lord, Lady Yulou and General Xue Tai

31:00.360 --> 31:02.120
are leading 100,000 troops
to besiege Yujun.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.680
They'll break through the gates soon.

31:03.760 --> 31:04.720
Please come back to defend.

31:08.640 --> 31:09.480
My lord,

31:09.960 --> 31:13.000
Lady Xu, Lady Zhu, and your wife
are still in Yujun.

31:14.240 --> 31:16.600
If the enemy breaches the city,
their lives will be at risk.

31:17.280 --> 31:18.960
Fifteen years ago in Xindu,

31:20.240 --> 31:22.160
the Wei clan lost three generations
of family members.

31:22.240 --> 31:23.240
Must we suffer

31:24.720 --> 31:26.280
the same again today?

31:34.800 --> 31:35.640
My lord,

31:37.000 --> 31:38.320
shall we march on Panyi

31:39.000 --> 31:40.680
or fall back to defend Yujun?

31:49.720 --> 31:53.880
You meant to protect Yanzhou from war,
didn't you, Grandfather?

31:54.240 --> 31:57.480
To sacrifice one or all?

31:58.200 --> 32:00.480
It would've been hard
for me to choose too.

32:05.360 --> 32:08.040
PANYI

32:11.920 --> 32:13.040
Pass on my orders.

32:13.560 --> 32:16.400
Let's march on Panyi
and retake the Yongning Canal.

32:16.480 --> 32:17.640
Yes.

32:20.840 --> 32:21.560
GOVERNMENT OFFICE

32:21.640 --> 32:23.920
Those seeking shelter
with nowhere else to go,

32:24.000 --> 32:25.080
regardless of age,

32:25.160 --> 32:27.720
may take refuge in the hall.

32:27.800 --> 32:30.240
My lady, I want to enlist.

32:30.640 --> 32:33.200
The enemy is at our doorstep.

32:33.680 --> 32:35.560
Though I am a woman,

32:35.640 --> 32:37.920
I refuse to be bullied.

32:38.000 --> 32:40.600
- I want to protect my home.
- Yes.

32:40.680 --> 32:44.200
I once followed the late lord
to fight across the land.

32:44.280 --> 32:46.640
Now the enemy's children
have reached our homes.

32:46.720 --> 32:47.520
Yes.

32:47.600 --> 32:50.280
We must show them the power of Wei.

32:50.360 --> 32:51.440
- Yes.
- Drive the enemy away!

32:51.520 --> 32:52.440
Defend Wei!

32:52.520 --> 32:54.640
Drive the enemy away! Defend Wei!

32:54.720 --> 32:56.880
I know you want to protect our home.

32:57.880 --> 32:58.880
Thank you all.

32:59.840 --> 33:01.000
Count us in.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.600
Count us in.

33:12.000 --> 33:14.760
We may fail in the battle today,

33:15.400 --> 33:18.240
but we stand here to tell everyone

33:19.760 --> 33:21.800
that the Wei clan
hasn't betrayed Wei State

33:21.880 --> 33:23.880
and never will.

33:24.480 --> 33:25.320
Yes.

33:25.800 --> 33:29.200
As long as the Wei clan stands,
Wei State stands.

33:29.760 --> 33:32.240
As long as the Wei clan stands,
Wei State stands.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.880
The Wei clan will stand with you.

33:34.960 --> 33:37.640
Defend Yujun! Protect Wei State!

33:37.720 --> 33:39.200
Defend Yujun!

33:39.280 --> 33:40.800
Protect Wei State!

33:40.880 --> 33:48.040
Defend Yujun! Protect Wei State!

33:55.160 --> 33:58.240
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

34:04.760 --> 34:05.640
Cheers! Come on!

34:06.240 --> 34:07.560
We're on duty. Drink less.

34:07.960 --> 34:09.480
What's there to fear?

34:09.560 --> 34:10.960
The battle is at Panyi.

34:11.040 --> 34:12.480
Who'd come here?

34:16.120 --> 34:17.080
Cheers!

34:17.520 --> 34:18.440
Come on!

34:18.520 --> 34:21.280
If you go to Kangjun, you can bring back
His Lordship's father-in-law

34:21.360 --> 34:23.320
and pick up an orchid on the way.

34:23.400 --> 34:25.120
Then you can marry Xiaotao
when you get back.

34:47.560 --> 34:48.360
Come on.

34:48.440 --> 34:50.000
Let me fill your bowl.

35:17.760 --> 35:19.080
Your face wasn't harmed.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.120
We're not staying here.

35:24.960 --> 35:26.560
I'm here to get you, Liang.

35:27.040 --> 35:28.600
I'm bringing you home.

35:33.000 --> 35:34.320
Aren't you Wei's greatest warrior?

35:34.400 --> 35:35.880
Why did you die here?

35:38.200 --> 35:39.400
How could you die here?

35:39.480 --> 35:42.040
Come on, come with me.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.760
I won't draw straws anymore, Liang.

35:44.840 --> 35:47.640
I won't.

35:48.400 --> 35:50.520
Get up. Come home with me.

35:50.600 --> 35:52.120
Get up!

35:52.200 --> 35:54.840
Get up. I can't carry you.

35:54.920 --> 35:57.120
We won't draw straws anymore.

35:57.200 --> 36:00.360
Xiaotao's waiting to marry you.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.800
Liang, let's go home.

36:01.880 --> 36:04.080
Let's go.

36:04.160 --> 36:04.960
You must be cold.

36:05.040 --> 36:07.960
Liang, we're not staying here.

36:11.200 --> 36:12.560
I'll bring you home.

36:15.800 --> 36:21.400
WEI

36:36.000 --> 36:37.480
The Wei clan

36:38.480 --> 36:40.560
still has to fight for the Qiao clan.

36:41.160 --> 36:43.080
His Lordship sent me to rescue a Qiao.

36:44.760 --> 36:45.920
Come with me.

37:29.520 --> 37:31.120
Enemy! Reinforce the defense!

37:31.200 --> 37:32.040
Yes.

38:13.160 --> 38:14.000
Liang.

38:19.200 --> 38:20.200
Liang.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.120
I lost an arm.

38:24.200 --> 38:25.200
Go to Kangjun

38:25.600 --> 38:26.800
and bring

38:28.000 --> 38:29.160
Wei Liang back.

39:35.160 --> 39:35.840
Who's there?

39:36.560 --> 39:37.960
Wei Qu, General of Wei.

39:38.760 --> 39:39.720
I'm here to rescue you.

39:42.280 --> 39:43.360
Thanks, General Wei.

39:45.000 --> 39:46.160
Can you see anything?

39:49.920 --> 39:51.200
Though I can't see,

39:52.560 --> 39:54.720
I still have some basic fighting skills.

39:55.440 --> 39:57.080
I won't hold you back.

39:58.000 --> 40:01.240
Just give me some instructions, General.

40:04.640 --> 40:05.520
Hold on to me tight.

40:17.480 --> 40:19.400
General, who's on your back?

40:21.480 --> 40:22.840
Wei Liang, General of Wei.

40:31.640 --> 40:33.600
You two, I suggest you surrender.

40:35.960 --> 40:37.400
This is Yanzhou.

40:37.480 --> 40:40.080
How can a Liangya man be in charge?

40:42.160 --> 40:44.040
Soldiers, you might not know,

40:44.760 --> 40:46.440
but your governor

40:46.520 --> 40:49.200
was killed in Panyi
by the Lord of Liangya.

40:50.080 --> 40:51.680
Liangya is hiding this

40:52.200 --> 40:54.320
to divide Yanzhou later.

40:58.320 --> 40:59.640
My brother is dead?

40:59.720 --> 41:01.680
Qiao Yue is dead.

41:02.480 --> 41:05.480
So, the prefect is the governor now.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.440
Are you sure

41:07.920 --> 41:09.720
you want to fight him now?

41:10.920 --> 41:11.840
Don't listen to him.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.280
Seize these two immediately.

41:13.360 --> 41:14.720
The Lord of Liangya is offering
a great reward!

41:14.800 --> 41:16.600
The Wei army will soon crush Panyi.

41:16.680 --> 41:19.000
The Lord of Liangya can barely
protect himself, let alone you.

41:19.880 --> 41:22.080
- Well…
- Think carefully.

41:22.960 --> 41:25.360
Will you listen to a Liangya man

41:26.360 --> 41:28.200
or your prefect?
